  "guidance": "Human Mutant levels 1-15 use the reviewed Mutant XP table. Each new level adds one retained D6 HP; Extraordinary Physical Endurance adds one retained D4 per attained level, including level 1. Skills and active training grow from their own learned level. Two new Secondary selections are earned at levels 3, 6, 9, 12 and 15. Undo restores pre-level values with a recovery save; replay reuses ordinary and power dice. Earned conditional maneuvers are shown as guidance; later attack choices, other power/category progression and special paths remain unfinished."
